// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3966777396" "This exercise focuses on the splendid world of Salvage. There are five types of Salvage, but the most common is Invention salvage. Invention Salvage is used to create many types of items.<br><br>There are different Rarities of Salvage, which translates to how often or rarely you find certain types of Salvage. The three Rarities are: Common, <color yellow>Uncommon,</color> and <color orange>Rare</color>. The color of the name and the information listed in the Information Bar will tell you exactly how common (or rare) your Salvage is.<br><br>How will you carry all of these new items?  I will tell you! You have an entire inventory dedicated to Salvage. The amount of Salvage pieces that you can carry is limited at first, but as you increase in Level, that will grow somewhat. The Imperial Bank of Cole, located in Nova Praetoria, Imperial City and Neutropolis, can also hold your Invention Salvage.<br><br>This last piece of information is simple:  you can sell your Salvage to any store in Praetoria.  You cannot buy it there, but you can at least sell it. You can even sell it to other Praetorians if you make your way over to the <color yellow>Trading House.</color><br><br>And now, I have an activity for you. <color orange>Go search the bookshelves and find more information on Salvage. Come back to me when you're done, I want to find out all the ways you've learned about Salvage.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2571566869" "Research Salvage in the Book Stacks"
// SendOffString :
"P3400746732" "Don't tarry now!  Research Salvage and give me feedback on your learning experience."
// RequiresFailedText :
"P552022597" "Well, that is all I have to teach you for now, {HeroName}.  Has it not been an exceptionally exciting and notably knowledgeable time we have had together?  Of course it has."

