"P344050836" "You find the required reading materials among the volumes in the bookcase."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Delivery_L_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1675227701" "Return with feedback on Salvage"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2524243545" "How is that activity on Salvage coming?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2119834445" "Well?  Let's hear your report!<br><br>Now that we've talked about how important Salvage is in creating things that can truly benefit Praetoria and, of course, give Emperor Cole reason to smile, let us move on the next exercise.  I have a minor task for you.  Oh come now, it's nothing, really.  Just a quick bit of retrieval, it'll take you no time at all.<br><br>So if you would be so kind as to march yourself over to the Materials Processing Room and pick up some Salvage and a few items for me, I would very much appreciate it.  Here's your list.  Quickly, quickly, like a bunny."

